  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator.BuildingBlocks#38] [Bug] ExceptionInfo captures only one level of InnerException — deep exception chains are truncated The old condition level == 0 only ever allowed one level of inner exception (since level was always 0 on the first call and 1 on the recursive call, never recursingfurther). The fix lets the   recursion continue until depth reaches MaxDepth (10), capturing the outer exception plus up to 10 inner exception levels.",
